163	    <h2>Checked and found sound</h2>
164	    <ul class="plain">
165	      <li>Order, fulfillment, payment and gift-card webhooks and emails are sent only after the database commit, so nothing goes out for a change that was rolled back.</li>
166	      <li>Fulfilling the full remaining quantity twice is rejected. Only overlapping partial fulfillments get through (FU-1).</li>
